    ProcessInfo *-- "0..*" MemorySection : memory_sections
    MemorySection *-- JvmEvidence : jvm
    ProcessEventConsumer ..> ProcessEvent : ingest 落库
    ProcessEventConsumer ..> RuleEngine : evaluate 复用 P2 规则
    RuleEngine ..> MemorySection : 读取 injection/pe_in_memory
